+  /* A document view that sizes itself to the clip view, a table view for
+     instance, can come out a fraction of a point larger than the area it is
+     shown in: at a fractional scale factor the two roundings need not agree.
+     Read as "does not fit" that fraction shows a scroller, which takes the
+     space away again, so the document view sizes itself down and the
+     scroller goes - and the two keep swapping sizes until the stack is
+     gone.  Less than a point does not fit a scroller either way. */
+  availWidth += fitSlack;
+  availHeight += fitSlack;
